            "detailed_description": "Pew pew pew RETRO STYLE! <br />\r\nShoot enemies, survive, gain lives and achieve the highest scores possible all in an old school vector style game. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSTART! <br />\r\nControl the TriBlaster in an unknown dimension and bring down your foes <br />\r\nThe goal is to survive and achieve high scores. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLEVEL COMPLETE! <br />\r\nRetro-games were never easy, and this ain't changing. Go go go! There are 100 levels waiting for you! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nACHIEVEMENT UNLOCKED! <br />\r\nCompleting levels isn't enough when you're a hardcore player, and what you need is more challenge, right? <br />\r\nSome of the achievements are hard to find. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGAME OVER! <br />\r\nThe good old &quot;Game Over&quot; screen, can't live without it. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures: <br />\r\n- Beam weapon based on how many resources you gather <br />\r\n- Jump back in space to avoid ennemies <br />\r\n- 100 levels",
