                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I feel like the game really starts around level 40. The difficulty is lower than I'd like before that, so when the difficulty level goes up it makes the game a lot more rewarding.\n\nI doubt the game will be updated any more (it's quite old now) but my wishlist would be:\n1. Harder difficulty earlier on. I want to be challenged before level 40, tbh.\n2. Vsync. I get a lot of tearing on my monitor, so it would nice to add the option for vsync.\n3. Would love the option to not have the camera rotate on those levels where it follows the rotation of the level. It's not very nice, really.\n\nOther than that, I think it's a fun game. It's nicely polished and works well, I just want more of a challenge from it difficulty-wise. I got it for like a dollar twenty or something and I'd definitely say I had my money's worth from it and I'll probably come back and start the game at a later level using the level select (good addition, that) so I can get to the harder stuff faster!!",
